      "writtenOn": "2026-06-18T00:12:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Seems the bare-metal toolchain does not include/support exception handling runtimes, so test fails.\n\nI think we only [disabled it for RISC-V](http://b/409825194), but some of those build failures are ARM (and your test was ARM).\n\n\u003e We can address FPMCU tests separately later if needed.\n\nPlease file a bug and add a TODO comment. I do need you to drive the fix though; I don\u0027t want to have to untangle all of this later when trying to build and run the unit tests.",
